  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: fix Coverity integer_division",
  "description": "fix Coverity issue\n\n```\nCID 1466401: (#1 of 1): Result is not floating-point (UNINTENDED_INTEGER_DIVISION)\ninteger_division: Dividing integer expressions this->layout_->bitWidth() and 3, and then converting the integer quotient to type double. Any remainder, or fractional part of the quotient, is ignored\n```\n\nUse qreal() casting:\n`qreal mark_w = qreal(layout_->bitWidth()) / 3;`",
